fault":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-03-28T01:20:07Z","updated_at":"2026-03-29T14:14:46Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.7dev3, 4.6.1, 4.2, 4.0\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev3 - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3090 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8180) - AMD Ryzen 9 5900XT 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 31.92 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nReflections and specular highlights are missing from the screen texture when MSAA and Subsurface Scattering is enabled in the Forward+ renderer.\n\nDisabling MSAA or Subsurface Scattering seems to fix the issue.\n\nBase scene:\n<img width=\"786\" height=\"660\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/57da1642-878b-4f14-b31b-3e0f20c67640\" />\n\nScene with a sphere that outputs the screen texture in front of the first sphere with MSAA:\n<img width=\"814\" height=\"756\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ddfe547a-8a87-4e6d-b2f1-2f848988aafb\" />\n\nSame as above, with MSAA disabled:\n<img width=\"933\" height=\"785\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/790e8584-9335-4070-8c88-a92045c1e3bc\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a mesh with a shader that outputs the screen texture as-is\n- Put it in front of a mesh with visible specular highlights/reflections and Subsurface Scattering enabled\n\nAlternatively:\n- open MRP\n- toggle the visibility of the ScreenSphere node\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[reflection.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26318144/reflection.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117920/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117920/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}